# CQ: Do expense, liability, asset and equity figures all roll up to financial-statement elements?
# Authored from the banking scope (PLAN.md), not from FIBEN's gold questions.
PREFIX fiben: <https://example.org/fiben/voc#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
ASK { fiben:Expense rdfs:subClassOf+ fiben:ElementOfFinancialStatement . fiben:Liability rdfs:subClassOf+ fiben:ElementOfFinancialStatement . fiben:Asset rdfs:subClassOf+ fiben:ElementOfFinancialStatement . fiben:Equity rdfs:subClassOf+ fiben:ElementOfFinancialStatement }
